+# ⚠️ PR-READY — READ THIS FIRST
+
+> **To the agent in the new session:** This workspace contains a complete, verified
+> website rebuild — a potential 627-file change (tools suite + site rebuild, see below).
+> **First run `git log --oneline -3` and `git status --short | wc -l`:**
+> - If a commit titled **"Rebuild as PDF-first tools suite — 558 tools total"** (e.g. `4133490`)
+>   is already HEAD → the work is committed; **skip Step 1**, just push (Step 2) and open the PR (Step 3).
+> - If the working tree shows ~627 uncommitted changes → commit first (Step 1), then push and PR.
+>
+> (This platform preserves file changes between sessions, but git commits only sometimes
+> survive — hence this file.) **Delete this file before making any new commit.**
+
+## What this is
+
+Full rebuild of Pixaroid as a **PDF-first tools site** (competitor to iLovePDF / Smallpdf / Sejda):
+- **PDF suite: 11 → 38 tools** — Word/Excel/PPT/HTML→PDF and back, organize/extract/remove
+  pages, page numbers, crop, resize, protect, unlock, sign, OCR, redact, add-text,
+  grayscale, extract-images, compress-to-target (100KB–2MB). All 100% client-side
+  (`tools/pdf-tools/js/pdf/pdf-engine.js` + new shared `pdf-tool-runner.js`).
+- **17 new utility/editor tools** — word counter, case converter, text-to-speech, password
+  generator, age/BMI/percentage calculators, typing speed test, QR generator + scanner,
+  fancy text, JSON formatter, lorem ipsum, favicon generator, barcode generator, voice
+  recorder, signature generator, text-to-handwriting, photo collage, add-text-to-image,
+  photo-to-cartoon.
+- **558 tools total.** New static homepage (replaced broken SPA shell), rebuilt PDF hub,
+  retitled utilities hub, sitemaps regenerated (545 tool URLs), 23 jpg→jpeg 301
+  redirects in `vercel.json`, JSON-LD + FAQ schema on every new page.
+- **Critical fix included:** orphaned `runBulk` code block removed from 256 tool pages +
+  the template (it broke the inline engine with a top-level `await`).
+- Deleted: bulk/batch tool pages, `tools/ai-tools/shared/*`, `tools/compress-jpeg-v2.html`.
+
+## Step 1 — Commit (delete this file first)
+
+```bash
+git add -A
+git commit -m "Rebuild as PDF-first tools suite — 558 tools total
+
+PDF suite (11 → 38 tools):
+- New: Word/Excel/PowerPoint/HTML to PDF, PDF to Word/Excel/PPT/HTML/Text,
+  Organize/Extract/Remove pages, Add page numbers, Crop, Resize, Protect,
+  Unlock, Sign, OCR, Redact, Add text, Grayscale, Extract images,
+  Compress to 100KB/200KB/500KB/1MB/2MB targets
+- Shared pdf-tool-runner.js runtime; PDFEngine extended with 20+ client-side ops
+- All pages generated from unified template with JSON-LD, FAQ, related links
+
+New utility/editor tools (17):
+- Word counter, case converter, text-to-speech, password generator,
+  age/BMI/percentage calculators, typing speed test, QR scanner,
+  fancy text, JSON formatter, lorem ipsum, favicon generator,
+  barcode generator, voice recorder, signature generator,
+  text-to-handwriting, photo collage, add-text-to-image, photo-to-cartoon
+
+Site structure:
+- Rebuild homepage as static PDF-first page (replaces broken SPA shell)
+- Rebuild PDF category hub; retitle utilities hub
+- Remove bulk/batch tool pages + unused AI shared scripts
+- 301 redirects: compress-jpg-to-* -> compress-jpeg-to-* (23)
+
+Fixes:
+- Remove orphaned runBulk block breaking inline engine in 256 pages + template
+- Sitemaps regenerated (545 tool URLs, all verified); list.json files updated"
+```
+
+Expected result: **627 files changed, ~11.8k insertions, ~18.4k deletions** (51 new tool
+pages + runner, 569 modified, 7 deleted). If the count differs, inspect `git status`
+before proceeding.
+
+## Step 2 — Push
+
+```bash
+git push origin HEAD
+```
+(Push whatever the session's working branch is — do NOT create other branches.)
+
+## Step 3 — Open the PR
+
+```bash
+gh pr create --title "Rebuild as PDF-first tools suite — 558 tools total" --body "..."
+```
+
+Suggested PR body:
+
+- **PDF suite 11 → 38 tools**: all Office/HTML conversions both ways, page organization
+  (organize/extract/remove/numbers/crop/resize), security (protect/unlock/sign/redact),
+  OCR, add-text, grayscale, extract-images, and target-size compression (100KB–2MB) —
+  100% client-side via shared `pdf-tool-runner.js` + extended `PDFEngine`
+- **17 new utility/editor tools**: word counter, case converter, TTS, password generator,
+  calculators (age/BMI/percentage), typing test, QR generator + scanner, fancy text,
+  JSON formatter, lorem ipsum, favicon generator, barcode generator, voice recorder,
+  signature generator, text-to-handwriting, photo collage, add-text-to-image,
+  photo-to-cartoon
+- **Site rebuild**: static PDF-first homepage (replaces broken SPA shell), rebuilt PDF
+  hub, retitled utilities hub
+- **SEO**: JSON-LD SoftwareApplication + FAQPage on all new pages, 23 jpg→jpeg 301
+  redirects, sitemaps regenerated (545 tool URLs verified)
+- **Fix**: removed orphaned `runBulk` block that broke the inline engine on 256 pages
+
+## Verification already done (2026-09-16)
+
+- 2,142 inline `<script>` blocks across 608 HTML files pass `node --check` (0 failures)
+- 0 broken internal links / asset srcs / JS refs (static auditor)
+- All 545 sitemap URLs resolve to real files; all JSON valid
+- All new pages serve HTTP 200 on a static server
+- No placeholder `${}` / `{{}}` leaks in generated pages
+
+*Written by the previous session on 2026-09-16. Delete this file before committing.*
